---
import { brand } from '../data/brand';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a href="/" class="footer-logo">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" width="28" height="28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect width="36" height="36" rx="8" fill="#10263F" stroke="#294F69" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M18 7L28 13V23L18 29L8 23V13L18 7Z" stroke="#6CDDE9" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M18 7V18M18 18L28 23M18 18L8 23" stroke="#3C92D4" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="footer-brand-name">{brand.name}</span>
        </a>
        <p class="footer-mission">
          LinkCube Data Story｜客观记录网络节点地区、线路技术原理与真实测速方法。杜绝虚假宣传，让数据回归真实连接。
        </p>
        <div class="footer-badge">
          <span class="status-badge status-listed">2026 数据透明度倡议</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-nav-groups">
        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4 class="footer-col-title">地区与拓扑</h4>
          <ul class="footer-col-list">
            <li><a href="/regions/#hong-kong">中国香港 (HK)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/regions/#japan">日本东京 (JP)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/regions/#singapore">新加坡 (SG)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/regions/#united-states">美国西海岸 (US)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/#routing">线路拓扑原理</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4 class="footer-col-title">数据与套餐</h4>
          <ul class="footer-col-list">
            <li><a href="/#data-reports">分时段数据报告</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pricing/">参考套餐对照</a></li>
            <li><a href="/data-methodology/">测速方法论与规范</a></li>
            <li><a href="/#reviews">用户体验反馈</a></li>
            <li><a href="/#faq">常见问题 FAQ</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4 class="footer-col-title">技术指南</h4>
          <ul class="footer-col-list">
            <li><a href="/guides/linkcube-region-evidence/">地区资料核查</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/linkcube-entry-exit/">入口与出口区别</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/linkcube-time-series/">早晚高峰数据分析</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/linkcube-data-quality/">测速报告信度判断</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/linkcube-pricing-sources/">套餐冲突核验</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/linkcube-region-updates/">资料持续更新</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4 class="footer-col-title">关于与条款</h4>
          <ul class="footer-col-list">
            <li><a href="/about/">关于本站</a></li>
            <li><a href="/privacy/">隐私政策</a></li>
            <li><a href="/terms/">服务条款</a></li>
            <li><a href="/sitemap.xml">站点地图 Sitemap</a></li>
            <li>
              <a
                href={brand.affiliateUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"
                style="color: var(--accent-cyan);"
              >
                客户端分发入口 ↗
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <div class="footer-copy">
        <p>© 2026 {brand.name} ({brand.chineseName}) Data Story. All rights reserved. 遵循简体中文数据诚信与可追溯规范。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: #050D1A;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .footer-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 2fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-brand-name {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .footer-mission {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .footer-nav-groups {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .footer-col-title {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .footer-col-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .footer-col-list a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .footer-col-list a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(41, 79, 105, 0.4);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .footer-disclaimer p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #7B8CA3;
  }

  .footer-disclaimer strong {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #5A6D85;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .footer-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .footer-nav-groups {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .footer-nav-groups {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
